     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Join us on Friday June 5, 2026 from 1pm – 3pm and learn more about the Stingers brand and their products."
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p><img src=\"assets/source/7f28f936-MA-Sweets-Flavs-1080.png\" alt=\"MA-Sweets-Flavs-1080.png\" title=\"Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" data-source-url=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/82dd1b_483b5e9fec2143448aef4934a3d22263~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_447,h_418,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/MA-Sweets-Flavs-1080.png\"></p><p>From Boston to the Berkshires, Stingers brings big flavor and serious fire to the Bay State. Our Massachusetts lineup is all about craft, potency, and pure satisfaction — featuring full-flower infused pre-rolls, slow-burning blunts, and our newest flavor-driven innovation, SWEETS by Stingers.</p><p>Each product is handcrafted using premium full flower, and high-grade cannabis extracts for smooth, flavorful, and reliable potency. Whether you’re rolling through Worcester or chilling on the Cape, Stingers delivers flavor you can taste and strength you can trust.</p><p><a href=\"/brands/stingers/\"><strong>Click here to shop Stingers products</strong></a></p>"
    },
